---
interface Props { lang: 'zh' | 'en'; }
const {lang}=Astro.props;
const zh=lang==='zh';
const root='/reading/weekly/005/';
---
<div class="issue-cover cover-005" aria-label={zh?'第 005 期杂志封面':'Issue 005 magazine cover'}>
 <div class="cover-masthead">
  <div class="cover-edition"><span>NO. 005</span><span>2026.10.18—10.24</span></div>
  <p class="cover-name">{zh?'AI 趋势周刊':'AI Trends Weekly'}</p>
  <p>{zh?'每周一更新 · 理解正在发生的变化':'Every Monday · Understand what is changing'}</p>
 </div>
 <div class="cover-art">
  <img src={root+'cover-05-less-960.webp'} srcset={root+'cover-05-less-480.webp 480w, '+root+'cover-05-less-960.webp 960w'} sizes="(min-width:1280px) 556px, (min-width:700px) 540px, calc(100vw - 40px)" width="960" height="1200" alt={zh?'蓝色贝雷帽、橙色围巾的 Airing 熊猫，把杂乱纸卷整理进三个抽屉。AI 概念插画。':'Airing, a panda in a blue beret and orange scarf, sorts a tangled paper ribbon into three compartments. AI concept illustration.'} fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/>
  <div class="cover-story">
   <p>{zh?'封面专题 · Agent 工程':'COVER STORY · AGENT ENGINEERING'}</p>
   <strong>{zh?'给 Agent':'Less weight.'}</strong>
   <h2>{zh?'做减法':'Better agents.'}</h2>
   <span>{zh?'800 行规则之后，重新安排工作':'After 800 lines of rules, rethink the work'}</span>
  </div>
  <span class="art-credit">{zh?'熊猫编辑台 · AI 概念插画':'The panda’s desk · AI illustration'}</span>
 </div>
 <div class="cover-teasers">
  <p><small>{zh?'证据观察':'EVIDENCE'}</small>{zh?'98% 的物理题，说明了什么？':'What does 98% in physics tell us?'}</p>
  <p><small>{zh?'工作与生活':'WORK & LIFE'}</small>{zh?'效率上升，快乐去了哪里？':'More efficient. More fulfilled?'}</p>
 </div>
 <div class="cover-byline"><span>{zh?'编辑':'Edited by'} <a href="https://ursb.me/">Airing</a></span><span>{zh?'17 篇阅读 · 5 个主题':'17 saves · 5 themes'}</span></div>
</div>
